    "ROOMS CONFIGURATION",
    "===================",
    "",
    "Each lab can declare which departments are allowed to schedule",
    "practicals in it via the `allowed_departments` field (a list of",
    "strings).",
    "",
    "  • If `allowed_departments` is omitted, null, or [], the lab is",
    "    open to every subject (subject to the existing commerce-room",
    "    exclusivity rules).",
    "  • If non-empty, only subjects whose `Department` value (in the",
    "    Subjects sheet of your input Excel) appears in this list may",
    "    use the lab. Matching is case-insensitive and trims whitespace.",
    "",
    "Use the same wording that appears in your Subjects sheet's",
    "`Department` column. Common short codes (CS, IT, CA) are also",
    "listed below alongside the long-form names, so either convention",
    "works without editing existing inputs.",
    "",
    "Adding a new lab? Copy one of the entries below, give it a unique",
    "`id`, set `type: \"lab\"`, capacity, optional `computers` count for",
    "computer labs, and the `allowed_departments` list."
  ],

